  "Hero upgrades: Lion Lv.{lion}, Owl Lv.{owl}, Turtle Lv.{turtle}": "영웅 업그레이드: 사자 Lv.{lion}, 부엉이 Lv.{owl}, 거북이 Lv.{turtle}",
